From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 16:45:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: observe legacy DA921x read-only provider

Add a default-off one-shot observation after the fixed legacy identity transcript and both read-only provider registrations. Reuse the exact selector, linear-voltage, and enable operations for both bucks, publish bounded read accounting and zero register-data writes, and invalidate the record after provider devres cleanup.

Add hardware-free KUnit coverage for success, each partial-read failure, incomplete lifecycle state, invalid semantic values, and cleanup. This experiment adds no setter, consumer, hardware write, transition owner, or CPU operation and is not submission-ready.
---
