 drivers/regulator/Makefile                    |   1 +
 .../regulator/da9213-legacy-observer-test.c   | 178 +++++++++++++++++
 drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-observer.h    |  47 +++++
 drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-regulator.c   | 186 +++++++++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 427 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-observer-test.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-observer.h

